## Find Maximum Subarray Sum


Kadane's Algorithm - 

arr = [-2, 1, -3, 4, -1, 2, 1, -5, 4]

current_sum = arr[0]
max_sum = arr[0]

for num in arr[1:]:
    current_sum = max(num, current_sum + num)
    max_sum = max(max_sum, current_sum)

print("Maximum subarray sum:", max_sum)

------------------------------------------------------

answer :-
          4 + (-1) + 2 + 1 = 6
          So answer = 6.

